WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 3

01:40.040 --> 01:42.480
SIFU HOUSE

01:43.200 --> 01:44.600
I can't believe you.

01:44.680 --> 01:45.880
Why are you being like this?

01:46.680 --> 01:48.320
I kindly let you consign your zither here.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.960
Now that the zither has been reserved

01:50.040 --> 01:51.240
and the deposit has been paid,

01:51.320 --> 01:52.680
you want to take it back?

01:52.760 --> 01:54.920
What am I supposed to say to the buyer?

01:55.000 --> 01:57.840
In three days, the buyer
will come with the money.

01:57.920 --> 01:59.480
Can't you wait another three days?

01:59.560 --> 02:02.400
I planned to stay in Bianjing
for two months

02:02.480 --> 02:04.880
but ran out of money.
That's why the zither is for consignment.

02:04.960 --> 02:06.600
I received a letter from home yesterday,

02:06.680 --> 02:09.320
saying my mother has fallen ill
and is eagerly waiting for my return.

02:09.400 --> 02:11.360
Let alone three days,
I can't wait one day more.

02:11.440 --> 02:13.960
You seem to be educated.
How can you go back on your word?

02:14.560 --> 02:17.120
We received the buyer's deposit
and waiting for them to pick up.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.680
If we can't hand over the zither,

02:18.760 --> 02:20.960
how can we continue to do business
on this street?

02:21.040 --> 02:21.920
- I…
- That can't happen.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.480
I won't allow that.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.680
- Give it to me.
- Stop that.

02:24.760 --> 02:26.520
Well, Mr. Liao.

02:27.480 --> 02:29.680
Why are you quarreling
with a customer in the street?

02:32.360 --> 02:33.280
Madam.

02:33.760 --> 02:36.760
- That man's outrageous. No credibility.
- Gentlemen, may I have your attention?

02:37.280 --> 02:40.000
I put my zither Bingqing here temporarily
for consignment.

02:40.080 --> 02:42.600
I don't want to sell it,
but they won't let me take it back.

02:43.200 --> 02:44.240
I am the owner.

02:44.320 --> 02:46.440
What they are doing is simply robbery!

02:46.520 --> 02:48.880
Bingqing? Isn't it a Lei zither
from the Tang dynasty?

02:49.640 --> 02:51.240
It's by the Lei family
in Shu prefecture.

02:51.320 --> 02:53.320
Exactly. Please take a look.

02:54.000 --> 02:57.000
It says, "On the third day of the third
lunar month of Dali Era's third year,

02:57.080 --> 02:58.840
made by the Lei family in Shu prefecture."

02:58.920 --> 03:01.320
It is indeed the genuine famous zither,
Bingqing.

03:01.400 --> 03:03.240
- It's a fine zither.
- Madam.

03:03.320 --> 03:04.520
- Can you--
- Here is the thing,

03:04.600 --> 03:05.760
I thought that shabby zither

03:05.840 --> 03:07.960
- was worth 30 strings.
- You shall see it for yourself.

03:08.040 --> 03:10.280
But just yesterday, a rich customer came

03:10.360 --> 03:12.480
and offered this amount right away.

03:13.320 --> 03:15.080
- Fifty strings?
- Fifty?

03:16.000 --> 03:17.480
No, 300 strings.

03:21.040 --> 03:23.480
That shabby zither is worth 300 strings?

03:23.560 --> 03:26.160
I heard the buyer has been collecting
items from 40 or 50 years ago

03:26.240 --> 03:28.240
for the family of the Transport Envoy
of Guangdong.

03:28.880 --> 03:31.120
He has also collected
many paintings and calligraphy arts.

03:31.200 --> 03:33.680
He insisted on having this zither.

03:33.760 --> 03:36.120
I told him that the seller
had made it clear beforehand

03:36.200 --> 03:37.920
he wouldn't sell
if they don't appreciate it.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.040
We made a deal

03:39.120 --> 03:41.720
that the seller must be notified
before the zither was picked up.

03:41.800 --> 03:43.960
The buyer set the contract,

03:44.040 --> 03:45.400
left 30 strings, and left.

03:47.000 --> 03:50.040
This shabby zither
isn't worth that much money.

03:50.120 --> 03:52.120
Who are they trying to fool?

03:52.200 --> 03:54.640
What the heart cherishes
can't be bought with a fortune.

03:54.720 --> 03:56.280
This is my first time seeing Lei zither.

03:56.360 --> 03:57.920
How about you sell it to me

03:58.640 --> 04:00.080
for 40 strings?

04:00.160 --> 04:02.600
- Forty?
- Sell it to me for 40 strings.

04:03.760 --> 04:04.800
Sixty-five.

04:04.880 --> 04:05.880
Sixty-eight.

04:05.960 --> 04:06.920
- 68 is a good price.
- 80.

04:07.000 --> 04:07.920
- That's a lot.
- You…

04:08.000 --> 04:08.920
- 100 strings.
- How much?

04:09.000 --> 04:09.840
- That much?
- You…

04:09.920 --> 04:11.600
This is an exorbitant price.

04:11.680 --> 04:12.640
Do you have the money?

04:12.720 --> 04:15.120
This is an astronomical price.

04:15.760 --> 04:16.720
Sir,

04:16.800 --> 04:19.040
doing business is all about reputation.

04:19.120 --> 04:21.200
We have received the buyer's deposit.

04:21.280 --> 04:23.200
- That's right.
- We can't just go back on our word.

04:23.280 --> 04:26.040
How about this? Name a price.

04:26.120 --> 04:28.160
I will make the decision to buy it.

04:28.800 --> 04:30.040
Well…

04:30.680 --> 04:31.800
Just name a price.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.720
I like this smell.

04:35.800 --> 04:38.160
Lady, look at this.
This one has a unique design.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.480
This one looks even better.

04:39.560 --> 04:41.320
OFFERING ALL KINDS OF TEA

04:41.400 --> 04:42.880
It matches the color of your clothes.

04:42.960 --> 04:44.800
- Here.
- Not bad.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.160
- It smells good.
- Have a try.

04:47.200 --> 04:48.680
You can try this.

04:56.160 --> 04:58.760
It smells so good,
and the scent is quite special.

04:58.840 --> 05:00.160
This one also smells very good.

05:01.080 --> 05:02.160
Then, I'll take this one.

05:02.240 --> 05:03.760
- I want this one.
- Alright.

05:04.880 --> 05:06.360
Young lady, take a look

05:06.440 --> 05:07.680
at this indigo-colored sachet.

05:07.760 --> 05:09.520
- It suits you more.
- This scent is quite nice.

05:15.160 --> 05:18.440
SIFU HOUSE

05:18.520 --> 05:19.400
This one is good too.

05:22.560 --> 05:27.200
SIFU HOUSE

06:05.080 --> 06:07.640
Mother, why are you crying?

06:08.240 --> 06:09.480
What's going on?

06:10.240 --> 06:12.320
- Why are you crying now?
- Mother!

06:12.960 --> 06:14.400
- What's wrong?
- What happened?

06:16.120 --> 06:18.440
Mother, why are you crying?

06:18.520 --> 06:20.720
What's wrong? What happened?

06:20.800 --> 06:21.960
Just tell us.

06:22.040 --> 06:23.520
Everything can be shared between us.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.520
Mother, just tell us.

06:26.600 --> 06:27.880
The dowry…

06:27.960 --> 06:31.200
- What about the dowry?
- The dowry…

06:31.280 --> 06:32.480
I think I know.

06:32.560 --> 06:34.800
The shop brought in a famous zither
at a high price.

06:34.880 --> 06:38.760
Mother has been waiting for days, but the
customer with the deposit hasn't shown.

06:39.360 --> 06:42.280
Mother, could it be
that you have been scammed?

06:42.360 --> 06:44.920
Yes, they were a bunch of scammers!

06:45.560 --> 06:46.600
How much did you spend?

06:51.360 --> 06:53.000
- One hundred…
- What?

06:53.600 --> 06:54.800
It's just a zither.

06:54.880 --> 06:56.880
It's worth ten to 20 strings at most.
You spent 100?

06:56.960 --> 06:58.760
No one will be fooled like that.

06:59.600 --> 07:04.600
It's 180 strings.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.520
Hundred and eighty strings?

07:06.600 --> 07:09.680
Mother, last time I asked you
for a hairpin,

07:09.760 --> 07:11.400
you even thought 180 coins were too much,

07:11.480 --> 07:14.320
and now, we are talking about 180 strings.

07:14.400 --> 07:16.760
Mr. Liao said someone

07:16.840 --> 07:18.560
would pay 300 strings for that zither.

07:18.640 --> 07:20.960
And those scammers kept saying

07:21.040 --> 07:22.120
that it was a treasure

07:22.200 --> 07:24.840
and a cherished item
that's worth a big fortune.

07:24.920 --> 07:28.600
As soon as I heard them,
I got dizzy and my vision blurred.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.160
It's like my mouth wasn't even my own.

07:30.240 --> 07:32.680
I just asked the price directly.

07:32.760 --> 07:34.960
Most of the money from selling the land

07:35.040 --> 07:37.280
has been spent on the shop.

07:37.360 --> 07:40.560
Now I lost 180 strings.

07:40.640 --> 07:43.160
That's the dowry for all of you.

07:44.480 --> 07:46.320
Those scammers should be cursed.

07:46.840 --> 07:49.400
It's like stabbing my heart

07:49.480 --> 07:51.880
with a knife.

07:51.960 --> 07:56.280
- Every time I think of it…
- Alright, alright.

07:56.360 --> 07:58.160
…it's like another stab.

07:58.240 --> 08:01.800
Mother, we are familiar
with perfumes and flowers.

08:01.880 --> 08:03.800
But not antiques, paintings,
and calligraphy arts.

08:04.400 --> 08:06.280
Last year, we set up a counter
for the trend,

08:06.360 --> 08:08.760
and it attracted many regulars
who love the flea market.

08:09.520 --> 08:12.000
Didn't we agree
not to buy in valuable items?

08:12.080 --> 08:13.840
How could you change that so easily?

08:13.920 --> 08:16.480
I bet those few are all in cahoots.

08:17.640 --> 08:18.560
Where is Mr. Liao?

08:19.200 --> 08:20.560
And the zither?

08:20.640 --> 08:21.840
I gave Mr. Liao

08:21.920 --> 08:24.240
a bout of scolding and drove him away.

08:24.320 --> 08:25.720
Afterwards, I still felt angry.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.640
I wanted to find an axe

08:27.720 --> 08:29.160
and cut that zither into firewood,

08:29.240 --> 08:31.120
but I couldn't find the axe.

08:31.200 --> 08:33.040
So, I just threw the zither away
at some place.

08:33.120 --> 08:34.120
You threw it away?

08:49.200 --> 08:50.720
Chunlai, go over there and look.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.400
Kangning,

08:57.480 --> 08:58.880
maybe someone has already taken it.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.560
Maybe we should stop looking and go back.

09:01.520 --> 09:04.320
Mother said when she threw the zither,
the night market hadn't ended yet.

09:05.520 --> 09:06.560
Maybe it's still here.

09:08.640 --> 09:11.680
Mother saved up for a long time
to get those 180 strings.

09:11.760 --> 09:13.280
How could we just give up like this?

09:15.280 --> 09:16.320
This is strange.

09:16.400 --> 09:18.760
Mother said she threw it here.
Where could it be?

09:58.560 --> 09:59.400
Do you hear that?

10:11.120 --> 10:12.680
Kangning, are we not looking anymore?

10:35.760 --> 10:37.320
Chai,

10:37.400 --> 10:39.360
don't think you can get away with this.

10:44.920 --> 10:48.240
XIANGGUO TEMPLE

10:48.320 --> 10:50.120
Come and take a look at the flowers.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.520
They are here.

10:55.360 --> 10:57.400
Do you think it will work?

10:57.480 --> 11:00.000
Mother, I've heard that Madam Chai
always prays on fasting days.

11:00.080 --> 11:03.080
Be it monks or Taoists, none are spared
her devotion. She is very pious.

11:03.160 --> 11:05.320
Just do as I taught you.

11:05.400 --> 11:06.560
It will work.

11:06.640 --> 11:07.600
Alright.

11:08.200 --> 11:09.400
- Then I'll go.
- Go.

11:19.480 --> 11:21.680
Thank you for blessing us, Bodhisattva.

11:21.760 --> 11:23.240
What's going on?

11:23.320 --> 11:26.560
Thank you.

11:30.040 --> 11:31.400
- Thank you, Bodhisattva.
- We have

11:31.480 --> 11:33.680
- five girls waiting for marriage.
- Please, Bodhisattva.

11:33.760 --> 11:34.920
- A few days ago…
- Thank you.

11:35.000 --> 11:35.840
…she came

11:35.920 --> 11:38.720
to worship the Bodhisattva and pray for
good marriages for her daughters.

11:38.800 --> 11:40.080
Her prayers have been heard.

11:40.160 --> 11:43.360
Now, we are here to thank the Bodhisattva.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.360
Thank you, Bodhisattva.

11:44.440 --> 11:46.080
Is it true they've all gotten married?

11:46.160 --> 11:47.760
Is this a deception or what?

11:48.360 --> 11:50.960
- I'd be a donkey to deceive you.
- Thank you.

11:51.040 --> 11:52.800
Is it really so effective?

11:53.960 --> 11:55.760
I don't know how many times I've kowtowed,

11:56.640 --> 11:59.120
how many bridges I've repaired,
and how many roads I've paved.

11:59.200 --> 12:00.680
My wishes have not been answered yet.

12:01.280 --> 12:03.640
How could a commoner have such blessings?

12:04.240 --> 12:06.480
- Go ask her again.
- Yes.

12:10.320 --> 12:11.680
Thank you so much.

12:11.760 --> 12:14.280
- Thank you for fulfilling my wishes.
- Madam, can you tell me more?

12:14.880 --> 12:17.720
It's a magical encounter
that our lady had.

12:17.800 --> 12:18.800
I don't know more.

12:20.720 --> 12:21.600
Madam, please.

12:23.520 --> 12:24.440
Alright.

12:24.520 --> 12:27.040
Since you are so sincere,
I'll tell you, but only you.

12:27.120 --> 12:28.160
Okay.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.080
That day,

12:29.160 --> 12:31.200
after we prayed to the Bodhisattva here,

12:31.280 --> 12:33.600
we were guided by the Bodhisattva.

12:34.760 --> 12:36.160
We met an old immortal.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.720
- An old immortal?
- Yes.

12:42.840 --> 12:45.360
Thank you for blessing us, Bodhisattva.

12:45.440 --> 12:47.200
Thank you.

12:47.280 --> 12:48.720
Thank you for fulfilling my wishes.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.200
You have suffered, Mother.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.640
Are you alright?

13:05.200 --> 13:06.800
How is it? Will it work?

13:07.960 --> 13:09.920
Let's wait and see.

13:11.240 --> 13:12.360
And we got this.

13:15.800 --> 13:17.480
Stop here.

13:17.560 --> 13:18.920
Hurry. Stop here.

13:19.560 --> 13:21.880
Make way at the front.
Why are you blocking the way?

13:25.200 --> 13:26.920
Our lady'd like to ask you
some questions.

13:27.520 --> 13:29.480
Is it the Third Lady Kangning
in the sedan chair?

13:32.480 --> 13:33.640
Master Chai,

13:33.720 --> 13:36.840
- have our families had any feuds?
- No.

13:36.920 --> 13:38.920
- Have we made enemies recently?
- No, we haven't.

13:39.000 --> 13:41.680
If that's the case,
why did you conspire with Mr. Liao

13:41.760 --> 13:42.800
to deceive my mother?

13:42.880 --> 13:45.080
Didn't you and your sisters

13:45.160 --> 13:46.360
also deceive Fan Lianghan?

13:47.080 --> 13:48.920
Master Fan and my second sister

13:49.000 --> 13:50.160
are a married couple.

13:50.240 --> 13:52.040
We are a family.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.760
There is no such thing as deceiving,

13:53.840 --> 13:54.880
but understandable humor.

13:54.960 --> 13:56.800
Fan Lianghan is my cousin.

13:56.880 --> 13:58.120
He is also my family.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.960
It's only right and proper

14:00.040 --> 14:01.680
that I seek justice for him.

14:04.000 --> 14:05.800
Master Chai, are you determined

14:05.880 --> 14:07.720
to give my family a hard time?

14:07.800 --> 14:10.360
That's not true.
Although I am no gentleman,

14:10.440 --> 14:12.400
I disdain to trouble women and children.
Deqing.

14:14.840 --> 14:16.320
What are you doing in broad daylight?

14:16.400 --> 14:18.040
Be careful, or we'll report you.

14:20.480 --> 14:23.440
Third Lady, the antique business
is often fraught with deceit,

14:23.520 --> 14:25.040
and your family is new here.

14:25.120 --> 14:26.640
You'll inevitably attract jealous eyes.

14:26.720 --> 14:29.680
I did this just to remind you.

14:29.760 --> 14:31.720
Business is not easy in Bianjing.

14:31.800 --> 14:33.440
You must be extremely careful from now on.

14:33.520 --> 14:36.080
Do not be credulous or greedy for money.

14:37.120 --> 14:40.040
You need to stay grounded
and avoid being rash and impulsive.

14:40.120 --> 14:42.720
If someone employs tricks
on you again in the future,

14:42.800 --> 14:44.200
presumably, you won't fall for them.

14:45.880 --> 14:46.880
You still don't get it?

14:47.600 --> 14:50.520
My master heard that someone
was going to target your family,

14:50.600 --> 14:51.720
so he warned you in advance.

14:52.440 --> 14:54.240
Now that you've learned your lesson,

14:54.320 --> 14:56.200
you can have the money back.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.080
Let's go.

15:07.760 --> 15:09.400
Chunlai, give it to me.

15:21.480 --> 15:23.440
That man is so strange.

15:23.520 --> 15:25.280
Why are there 40 strings less?

15:26.400 --> 15:29.320
My master said that the 30 strings
of interest money must be repaid,

15:29.400 --> 15:32.360
and you have to pay the rent for our
shopkeeper, calligraphy, and paintings.

15:34.160 --> 15:35.160
Villain!

15:38.960 --> 15:41.040
We don't need you to give us the warning.

15:41.120 --> 15:43.040
It was clearly deliberate mockery.

15:44.000 --> 15:45.400
We didn't go to you,

15:45.480 --> 15:46.880
yet you came to me.

15:47.560 --> 15:50.520
Fine, then bask in your pleasure
a little longer.

15:51.120 --> 15:53.080
Let's see if you can
stay this way afterwards.

15:55.560 --> 15:56.440
Mother,

15:57.240 --> 15:58.560
I'm back.

15:58.640 --> 16:00.320
You are finally back.

16:00.400 --> 16:01.960
You run around all day.

16:02.560 --> 16:05.000
Even I have to send someone
to fetch you when I want to see you.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.560
I got held up a few days ago.

16:06.640 --> 16:07.920
Please forgive me, Mother.

16:08.000 --> 16:10.720
Has anything good happened?
I haven't seen you this joyful in a while.

16:10.800 --> 16:13.120
With you always striving for better,

16:13.200 --> 16:15.520
I don't worry a bit about the businesses,

16:15.600 --> 16:16.440
except for one thing.

16:17.240 --> 16:19.040
- You know it.
- Mother.

16:19.120 --> 16:21.040
Why are you bringing it up again?

16:21.960 --> 16:23.400
I have my own plans

16:23.480 --> 16:24.520
about my marriage.

16:24.600 --> 16:26.000
What plans could you possibly have?

16:26.080 --> 16:27.600
Stop putting me off

16:27.680 --> 16:28.920
by making excuses.

16:29.000 --> 16:30.920
It's been years.

16:31.000 --> 16:34.000
Even that good-for-nothing Fan Lianghan
got married before you.

16:34.080 --> 16:36.040
How can I be at peace?

16:36.720 --> 16:39.200
I know you're with high aspirations.

16:39.280 --> 16:42.760
When your father was here, he wished you'd
marry a lady from a scholar's family.

16:42.840 --> 16:45.120
Since you agreed,
you will keep your promise.

16:45.880 --> 16:47.480
Rest assured. That wish will be fulfilled

16:47.560 --> 16:48.880
at the latest by next year.

16:50.400 --> 16:51.240
Why is that?

16:51.320 --> 16:54.680
I met an old immortal
on my way out yesterday.

16:55.280 --> 16:56.560
He travels to all places,

16:56.640 --> 16:59.160
only to raise money
to repair a Taoist temple.

16:59.240 --> 17:03.120
As long as I donate some money,
you'll be able to marry a wife next year.

17:03.200 --> 17:06.560
Mother, immortals
are supposed to be in temples.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.560
Since when do you see them
running in the streets?

17:09.040 --> 17:11.560
Why have you started
believing in such street swindlers?

17:12.560 --> 17:14.160
The streets are bustling

17:14.240 --> 17:16.320
with ordinary mortals.

17:18.520 --> 17:19.760
He couldn't be an immortal.

17:19.840 --> 17:21.520
He was a true immortal.

17:22.120 --> 17:24.320
Before I even spoke, he knew my wishes

17:24.400 --> 17:26.480
and the situation of our family.

17:26.560 --> 17:27.960
Every word he said was precise.

17:28.040 --> 17:29.480
I don't care.

17:29.560 --> 17:31.240
I promised to donate money

17:31.320 --> 17:32.920
for the temple's building.

17:33.640 --> 17:35.120
I've already made the donation.

17:35.200 --> 17:37.040
Giving out wealth is a blessing.

17:37.120 --> 17:39.240
If you wish to donate for inner peace,
then let it be.

17:40.080 --> 17:40.960
Okay.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.920
How much did you donate?

17:43.520 --> 17:45.240
I wanted to donate more,

17:45.320 --> 17:47.040
but he wouldn't take it.

17:47.120 --> 17:48.840
I didn't donate much. Only 180 strings.

17:55.760 --> 17:58.680
PAN RESTAURANT

17:59.920 --> 18:01.120
Sir.

18:01.200 --> 18:03.720
- That Third Lady sent a message.
- What is it?

18:03.800 --> 18:06.000
She wants to thank you
for your generous donation.

18:06.600 --> 18:08.640
It only took 100 coins
to thank the immortal.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.120
The rest has been returned in full.

18:10.200 --> 18:12.160
She wants you to remember

18:12.240 --> 18:15.120
that however clever you are,
there is always someone more clever.

18:15.680 --> 18:18.240
- You shouldn't…
- Shouldn't what?

18:19.920 --> 18:23.600
You shouldn't act pompous and arrogant,
which makes you a person of narrow view.

18:26.920 --> 18:27.840
Move closer.

18:47.520 --> 18:50.240
SIFU HOUSE

18:50.320 --> 18:51.400
My lady,

18:52.040 --> 18:53.600
they've returned the money to us,

18:53.680 --> 18:57.560
saying it's just a tad of money,
and it's not significant.

18:58.400 --> 19:00.760
They even said that if you fancy it,

19:00.840 --> 19:02.640
you can buy yourself some flowers with it.

19:03.400 --> 19:04.520
That's cheeky.

19:04.600 --> 19:05.720
They can't admit defeat,

19:05.800 --> 19:06.720
but mock us instead.

19:07.920 --> 19:10.360
This is sarcasm
about my family being poor.

19:10.880 --> 19:13.440
We can't take a coin
of the ill-gotten wealth.

19:13.520 --> 19:15.160
Otherwise, for what you take today,

19:15.240 --> 19:16.440
they'll take a hundredfold back

19:16.520 --> 19:17.840
from you later.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.480
Come here.

19:25.560 --> 19:28.080
- Come.
- Young lady!

19:28.160 --> 19:30.640
- Young lady!
- Thank you, young lady!

19:30.720 --> 19:31.920
- There's enough for both.
- Okay.

19:32.000 --> 19:33.520
- Don't fight over the money.
- Thank you!

19:33.600 --> 19:35.200
You have the heart of a Bodhisattva.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.280
Thank you, young lady!

19:36.360 --> 19:37.560
Thank you, young lady!

19:37.640 --> 19:39.080
Alright.

19:39.160 --> 19:41.360
They are giving away our money, my master.

19:41.440 --> 19:45.320
Let's go. Hurry.

19:45.400 --> 19:47.440
Let's go buy something tasty.

19:50.240 --> 19:51.280
Young master!

19:52.720 --> 19:55.000
What? You could deceive her,

19:55.080 --> 19:56.200
but she couldn't deceive you?

19:56.840 --> 19:58.360
Anyway, I gave her the money.

19:58.440 --> 19:59.760
Besides, Mother wants that money

19:59.840 --> 20:01.080
to be used for good deeds.

20:01.160 --> 20:03.120
Weren't they just doing good deeds?

20:03.200 --> 20:04.760
So, that's it? You will do nothing?

20:05.360 --> 20:07.040
As a lady of the inner chamber,

20:07.120 --> 20:09.400
she knows not to touch unrighteous wealth.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.840
It makes me admire her a bit more.

20:11.560 --> 20:12.400
However,

20:12.480 --> 20:14.880
acting so rashly and impetuously will lead

20:15.560 --> 20:17.040
to great losses for her in the future.

20:26.600 --> 20:27.600
Master Chai.

20:28.240 --> 20:29.200
Master Chai.

20:29.280 --> 20:31.200
I went to Dongji'er Lane to see Lu Yanyan.

20:31.280 --> 20:32.720
I begged and pleaded,

20:32.800 --> 20:34.440
offering all sorts of jewelry,

20:34.520 --> 20:35.600
brocades, and fine gauze.

20:35.680 --> 20:38.320
Finally, she agreed
to attend the banquet at Pan.

20:38.440 --> 20:40.320
You need to buy me
half a year's worth of liquor.

20:40.400 --> 20:42.600
Young master, Master Yang came again.

20:42.680 --> 20:45.520
He cursed away three, four companions
and drank two jars of wine quietly.

20:46.200 --> 20:47.880
I wonder if he will cause trouble.

20:58.800 --> 21:01.080
YANG XIAN

21:02.400 --> 21:03.640
Leave him be.

21:04.400 --> 21:05.480
Master Chai.

21:06.240 --> 21:07.120
Master Chai.

21:07.920 --> 21:10.200
Master Chai,
when the Mid-Autumn comes…

21:10.920 --> 21:11.760
Please hear me out.

21:11.840 --> 21:14.440
I see. I have things to do today.
Let's talk another day.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.360
Master Chai.

21:16.280 --> 21:17.360
Master Chai.

21:18.120 --> 21:19.960
What's going on?

21:20.040 --> 21:21.560
It's purely bad timing.

21:22.400 --> 21:23.920
My master is in a bad mood.

21:24.000 --> 21:26.000
He can't get the bellyful of anger
out of his chest.

21:27.840 --> 21:30.560
- What happened?
- My master is magnanimous.

21:30.640 --> 21:32.200
He doesn't stoop to fight with a woman.

21:32.280 --> 21:34.760
Forget about it.
You didn't hear me saying anything.

21:36.280 --> 21:38.200
Tell me about it. You never know.

21:38.280 --> 21:40.200
I may be able to help him
get this sullenness out.

21:49.320 --> 21:50.240
It's her again.

21:51.800 --> 21:52.920
I still have that slap

21:53.000 --> 21:53.960
on my account.

21:54.040 --> 21:55.120
The beef wasn't settled yet.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.440
Exactly.

21:56.520 --> 21:57.800
Even if you search all Bianjing,

21:57.880 --> 21:59.920
you won't find a second one
as shrewish as she is.

22:00.000 --> 22:01.120
I don't think that's true.

22:01.600 --> 22:04.240
There are six tigresses in the Li family.
A profound family heritage.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.720
What on earth are you singing?

22:06.800 --> 22:08.800
There is no strength in your singing.
Get lost.

22:14.880 --> 22:16.160
No hurry. I'll go take a look.

22:40.360 --> 22:42.000
Deqing. Deqing.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.800
Yes, sir?

22:45.440 --> 22:46.400
Give the order.

22:46.480 --> 22:47.880
I want the new wine gathering

22:47.960 --> 22:50.120
before Mid-Autumn to be grand and lively.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.920
I'd like all of Bianjing to come and see,

22:52.000 --> 22:53.920
so we can take down the arrogance
of Sifu House.

22:54.000 --> 22:54.960
Okay.

22:57.800 --> 22:59.880
SIFU HOUSE

23:01.080 --> 23:04.280
MID-AUTUMN DAY
THE 15TH DAY OF THE EIGHTH LUNAR MONTH

23:18.640 --> 23:20.000
They are washed quite thoroughly.

23:21.120 --> 23:24.000
Our business is starting
to look promising.

23:24.080 --> 23:26.280
We must be more attentive
during the Mid-Autumn Festival.

23:28.000 --> 23:29.040
Be careful.

23:29.120 --> 23:30.040
Be a bit more careful.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.520
Everyone, be quick about it.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.760
- Here.
- We know, Mother.

23:34.840 --> 23:36.600
Come on. Be quicker about it.

23:36.680 --> 23:38.040
- Careful.
- There won't be mistakes.

23:38.120 --> 23:39.200
- Alright.
- Just rest assured.

23:41.760 --> 23:42.600
Chunlai,

23:42.680 --> 23:43.960
put these in place neatly.

23:44.040 --> 23:45.400
This area needs to be sorted out.

23:45.480 --> 23:46.720
Okay.

23:46.800 --> 23:48.000
Jiang.

23:48.080 --> 23:49.760
You need to trim the tree and the flower.

23:49.840 --> 23:51.720
- Trim them to make them look nicer.
- Okay.

23:52.880 --> 23:54.440
This area is done.

23:54.520 --> 23:55.800
This needs to be taken care of.

24:00.240 --> 24:01.680
You can't take down this painting.

24:01.760 --> 24:03.600
Many people come for this genuine piece.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.680
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

24:05.760 --> 24:08.600
Scholars will be inspired to write poetry
after drinking some wine.

24:08.680 --> 24:11.240
We can offer some cheap brushes and ink,

24:11.320 --> 24:13.000
so that they can

24:13.080 --> 24:15.880
write a poem or compose a verse
on this blank wall.

24:16.600 --> 24:19.760
During next year's Spring Examination,
if someone becomes the Number One Scholar,

24:19.840 --> 24:21.640
this will become
the Number One Scholar's Wall.

24:21.720 --> 24:24.600
To write a poem on it,
you must be a famous or talented scholar.

24:24.680 --> 24:26.920
That's a good idea.

24:27.000 --> 24:29.560
They're full of boasting on ordinary days.

24:29.640 --> 24:31.760
Now I'd like to see
which of them has genuine talent.

24:31.840 --> 24:33.160
I will take them as my son-in-law.

24:33.880 --> 24:35.840
Dear daughter, you are so intelligent.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.360
I'll listen to you.

24:40.360 --> 24:41.280
What are you doing?

24:41.360 --> 24:43.760
I'll keep this painting for you.

24:43.840 --> 24:45.480
Mother, we need to return this painting.

24:45.560 --> 24:48.640
Well, he openly steals my business.
So what if I keep his painting?

24:48.720 --> 24:50.320
Mother, we can't keep this painting.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.240
Mother.

24:54.880 --> 24:56.520
PAN RESTAURANT

25:00.880 --> 25:01.760
PAN RESTAURANT

25:01.840 --> 25:03.320
It's a rare sight.

25:03.960 --> 25:05.320
We did the right thing coming here.

25:05.400 --> 25:06.320
Exactly.

25:06.920 --> 25:08.480
It's a feast for the eyes.

25:10.440 --> 25:11.680
That's right.

25:13.400 --> 25:15.000
It is so different.

25:15.680 --> 25:16.800
It's thanks to Master Chai

25:16.880 --> 25:18.200
- for coming up with the idea.
- Yes.

25:21.600 --> 25:23.080
We've waited for this for a long time.

25:28.680 --> 25:29.920
Raise the signboard.

25:35.320 --> 25:36.440
Nice move.

25:36.520 --> 25:37.920
Truly impressive.

25:38.000 --> 25:39.800
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

25:39.880 --> 25:41.960
THE BEST IN BIANJING

25:42.040 --> 25:43.800
Great move.

25:43.880 --> 25:46.120
Good skills. Such talent.

25:46.200 --> 25:48.560
I wonder whether the wine is good.

25:48.640 --> 25:50.760
Right. How's the wine?

25:50.840 --> 25:53.400
Ladies and gentlemen, the host

25:53.480 --> 25:55.440
doesn't boast about
whether the wine is good.

25:55.520 --> 25:57.040
You can taste and find out yourselves.

25:57.120 --> 26:00.280
This year, as the new owner
of Pan Restaurant,

26:00.360 --> 26:02.480
not only do I invite you
to taste the wine,

26:02.560 --> 26:04.160
but I also invite everyone in Bianjing

26:04.240 --> 26:06.640
to come and try the Jade Wine
to see whether it's good or not.

26:06.720 --> 26:08.800
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

26:08.880 --> 26:11.680
Please welcome the best courtesan.

26:11.760 --> 26:14.320
- Bravo.
- It's the best courtesan.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.440
She is here.

26:20.040 --> 26:21.040
Lu Yanyan!

26:21.120 --> 26:23.520
- Lu Yanyan!
- The best courtesan.

26:23.600 --> 26:25.800
- Lu Yanyan!
- Lu Yanyan!

26:25.880 --> 26:28.480
- Lu Yanyan!
- Lu Yanyan!

26:29.440 --> 26:30.280
She's looking at me.

26:30.360 --> 26:31.600
- She's looking at me.
- Lu Yanyan!

26:31.680 --> 26:33.440
- She is so beautiful.
- Lu Yanyan!

26:34.240 --> 26:35.720
Come on. Let's go.

26:35.800 --> 26:37.000
Let's go.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.320
Over here.

26:44.640 --> 26:46.800
Pan Restaurant is launching
its new wine today.

26:46.880 --> 26:47.720
Come on.

26:47.800 --> 26:49.880
Come to Pan Restaurant
and try the new wine.

26:49.960 --> 26:51.480
This method isn't bad.

26:51.560 --> 26:53.680
- The smell of the wine disperses fast.
- Pan's new wine!

26:54.400 --> 26:55.920
Pan Restaurant is launching a new wine.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.520
- Come and taste. Try it.
- Come on.

26:57.600 --> 26:59.880
- Pan Restaurant is launching a new wine.
- Here. Try it.

26:59.960 --> 27:01.480
Here. Try it.

27:01.560 --> 27:04.240
- Pan is launching a new wine.
- Pan is launching a new wine today.

27:04.320 --> 27:05.720
Everyone, come and show support.

27:05.800 --> 27:07.960
Pan Restaurant
is launching a new wine today.

27:08.040 --> 27:09.800
Everyone, come and have a try.

27:11.480 --> 27:12.920
- Look.
- Try some.

27:14.840 --> 27:16.040
Here. Try some.

27:16.640 --> 27:18.120
- Try it.
- Okay.

27:18.200 --> 27:19.720
- Here, try it.
- Thank you.

27:19.800 --> 27:21.360
Everyone, come and try it.

27:22.520 --> 27:24.480
You're welcomed to come and try!

27:25.680 --> 27:27.200
Pan Restaurant is launching a new wine.

27:27.280 --> 27:28.800
Come and try it.

27:29.400 --> 27:30.800
Master Wang, you are here.

27:30.880 --> 27:32.360
- Got a pot of Jade Wine for you.
- Good.

27:32.440 --> 27:33.600
Been expecting you. Come.

27:33.680 --> 27:36.440
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

27:37.520 --> 27:38.840
Welcome.

27:38.920 --> 27:40.480
- It's so grand.
- Let's go out and see.

27:40.560 --> 27:42.440
No wonder they are so extravagant.

27:48.560 --> 27:50.440
Sir, you always have good ideas.

27:50.520 --> 27:52.680
With the parade going around the city,
all hear the news.

27:54.480 --> 27:56.080
Please come in.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.040
Deqing.

28:01.280 --> 28:03.440
Take down the wine sign in the afternoon.

28:03.520 --> 28:05.360
Tell the guests
today's Jade Wine is sold out

28:05.440 --> 28:06.760
and they can come early tomorrow.

28:06.840 --> 28:07.680
Okay.

28:09.800 --> 28:12.480
Mother, stop watching.
Let's go back to business.

28:13.320 --> 28:14.960
There is no business at all.

28:15.040 --> 28:17.920
We got up before dawn
and have been busy until now,

28:18.000 --> 28:19.560
all for today's business.

28:20.200 --> 28:21.640
All the people on this street

28:21.720 --> 28:23.160
have been lured away by him.

28:23.240 --> 28:24.480
There is no business at all.

28:37.480 --> 28:39.400
Liang was right.

28:39.480 --> 28:40.880
She somewhat resembles the portrait.

28:43.280 --> 28:46.080
It's just she's too far away.
I can't see her clearly either.

28:47.520 --> 28:49.240
Haode and Leshan
have gone out to play again.

28:50.520 --> 28:51.600
Kangning,

28:51.680 --> 28:53.040
you stay for the business.

28:53.120 --> 28:54.480
I'll go look for those two.

28:55.760 --> 28:57.040
Chunlai, go with her.

29:21.640 --> 29:22.960
Please.

29:23.040 --> 29:24.280
Congratulations.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.880
- Please.
- Congratulations.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.280
Please come in.

29:34.480 --> 29:36.720
Young master,
Master Liu from Daming Prefecture

29:36.800 --> 29:38.200
ordered 200 jars of Jade Wine.

29:38.280 --> 29:40.840
He is the most anxious to get it.
I feel we can't reason with him.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.560
- I'll go take a look.
- Okay.

29:44.200 --> 29:45.040
Deqing.

29:45.720 --> 29:47.480
My mother will come too.
Wait at the door.

29:47.560 --> 29:49.800
Then lead her to the pavilion,
to avoid the crowds.

29:49.880 --> 29:51.760
Understood. Rest assured, sir.

29:54.920 --> 29:56.160
- Please come inside.
- This way.

30:16.000 --> 30:18.080
Good idea. You are the most ingenious one.

30:18.160 --> 30:20.240
- Hurry and ask the cook to prepare.
- Okay.

30:23.840 --> 30:25.320
Our shop has a new shuanglu game.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.680
No, thank you.

30:26.760 --> 30:29.840
- Master Wang, a game of shuanglu?
- Let's go drink up front.

30:29.920 --> 30:32.040
It's harmful to your health
if you drink too much wine.

30:32.120 --> 30:34.320
- Been a long time. Why--
- No. I'm going to Pan Restaurant.

30:34.400 --> 30:35.480
Come here. We have shuanglu.

30:35.560 --> 30:37.640
- I'll go to Pan Restaurant too.
- There's nothing there.

30:37.720 --> 30:39.440
We have set up a shuanglu game
at our place.

30:40.320 --> 30:41.960
We have a new shuanglu game at our place.

30:42.040 --> 30:44.160
- Come, join us at Sifu--
- I'm heading to Pan Restaurant.

30:44.840 --> 30:46.040
What's so good about it?

30:46.120 --> 30:48.440
It was her. She swindled my money.

30:50.920 --> 30:51.760
This is bad.

30:51.840 --> 30:53.280
Take her to the officials.

30:56.280 --> 30:57.280
What are you doing?

30:57.360 --> 30:59.160
What's going on? What are you doing?

30:59.240 --> 31:00.960
- What are you doing?
- What?

31:05.000 --> 31:08.520
Fellow citizens, come and take a look.

31:08.600 --> 31:10.160
Relying on her money,

31:10.240 --> 31:12.160
someone here is bullying us

31:12.240 --> 31:13.880
because we are not locals

31:13.960 --> 31:16.280
who have no backing or support.

31:16.360 --> 31:17.560
What's going on?

31:18.160 --> 31:20.080
In broad daylight, how can you bully her?

31:20.160 --> 31:22.520
Yes, indeed.
Listen to me. Let's not get physical.

31:23.120 --> 31:24.280
Let me reason with you.

31:24.360 --> 31:26.200
It's not too late to get physical
if words fail.

31:26.280 --> 31:27.480
Exactly.

31:28.080 --> 31:29.880
You shameless vulgar woman
and lying swindler!

31:29.960 --> 31:30.920
Shut her mouth!

31:31.000 --> 31:32.640
W-Who's the swindler?

31:32.720 --> 31:34.280
Go shut her mouth quickly.

31:34.360 --> 31:35.960
- You say I'm a swindler?
- What's going on?

31:36.040 --> 31:37.800
I'm not a swindler.

31:37.880 --> 31:38.800
You say I'm a swindler?

31:38.880 --> 31:40.520
I'm not a swindler.

31:40.600 --> 31:42.160
- Quick, stop her.
- I'm not a swindler.

31:43.760 --> 31:44.960
Who are you calling a swindler?

31:45.040 --> 31:46.440
You say I'm a swindler?

31:47.880 --> 31:49.080
Who's a swindler, huh?

31:50.440 --> 31:51.560
Say it.

31:55.360 --> 31:57.760
Who's a swindler, huh?

32:00.560 --> 32:01.880
Who are you calling a swindler?

32:01.960 --> 32:03.320
Who are you calling a swindler?

32:03.400 --> 32:05.600
- You say I'm a swindler?
- Mother!

32:05.680 --> 32:07.560
- Mother!
- Mother!

32:07.640 --> 32:09.000
- What's the matter?
- It's alright.

32:09.080 --> 32:10.760
- Let's go home.
- Go away.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.760
Listen to me.

32:12.840 --> 32:15.000
I am naturally fierce.

32:15.680 --> 32:17.320
Even if ten of your men come at me,

32:17.400 --> 32:18.760
when I'm provoked,

32:18.840 --> 32:19.960
I will make you

32:20.040 --> 32:21.600
turn into clawless crabs one by one.

32:22.840 --> 32:24.320
- Who is the swindler, huh?
- Move aside.

32:24.400 --> 32:26.480
- Who is the swindler?
- Enough, Mother.

32:27.360 --> 32:29.280
What are you doing? Let's go back.

32:31.240 --> 32:33.840
- Mother!
- Stop fighting.

32:34.680 --> 32:38.560
Mother! Mother!

32:38.640 --> 32:40.240
Mother, stop fighting.

32:50.880 --> 32:51.840
Calm down, Mother.

32:53.120 --> 32:54.600
My apologies. Don't take offense.

32:54.680 --> 32:55.720
Stop fighting.

32:56.440 --> 32:58.040
- Mother, let's go back.
- Calm down.

32:58.120 --> 32:59.600
Third Lady, quickly take your mother.

33:00.200 --> 33:01.320
Mind your own business.

33:02.760 --> 33:03.920
- Enough, Mother.
- Let's go.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.440
Let's go back to the pavilion first.

33:05.520 --> 33:08.280
- This isn't over!
- Let's go back to the pavilion first.

33:08.360 --> 33:10.280
Mother, our own business
is more important.

33:10.360 --> 33:11.200
She is right.

33:14.640 --> 33:15.520
Let's go.

33:15.600 --> 33:16.440
- Disperse.
- Let's go.

33:16.520 --> 33:17.600
- Let's go.
- Disperse now.

33:17.680 --> 33:18.640
Stop looking.

33:19.640 --> 33:20.560
You gave me a fright.

33:21.080 --> 33:22.440
Let's go.

33:22.520 --> 33:23.480
Let's go.

33:26.480 --> 33:27.600
There's a new trick again.

33:27.680 --> 33:28.680
Come on.

33:29.360 --> 33:31.640
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

33:32.440 --> 33:34.320
Baifan Restaurant, Taiping Restaurant,

33:34.400 --> 33:38.040
and Chunfeng Restaurant all sell new wine.

33:39.120 --> 33:40.960
As the saying goes,

33:41.040 --> 33:44.440
"One cup of wine and the fierce tiger
lie in the mountains,

33:45.000 --> 33:49.720
and two cups and the dragon sleeps
in the sea depths."

33:49.800 --> 33:52.120
If you have three cups,

33:52.200 --> 33:54.480
I assure you your guts

33:54.560 --> 33:59.000
will be turning upside down.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.760
To those passing by,

34:01.840 --> 34:04.320
have a bowl of our shop's hangover soup.

34:04.400 --> 34:09.640
I guarantee you'll get less scolding
when you get home.

34:10.480 --> 34:12.680
The dark plum and osmanthus hangover soup

34:12.760 --> 34:15.080
quenches thirst and refreshes you
with a fragrant aroma.

34:15.160 --> 34:16.680
It costs only three coins per bowl.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.760
It's very cheap.

34:18.880 --> 34:20.160
It smells good. I'll have a bowl.

34:20.240 --> 34:22.200
- I'll have one too.
- Please, come this way.

34:22.800 --> 34:23.760
Three coins per bowl.

34:23.840 --> 34:26.240
- It's very cheap.
- Only three coins per bowl.

34:27.800 --> 34:28.640
Madam Li,

34:29.680 --> 34:31.920
you've hidden away
such a beautiful daughter.

34:32.000 --> 34:33.440
Willing to let her serve drinks,

34:33.520 --> 34:35.600
you must be earning a vast fortune.

34:36.200 --> 34:37.960
Exactly.

34:38.720 --> 34:40.320
If you keep spewing nonsense,

34:40.400 --> 34:44.080
I'll gouge out those toad eyes of yours
and put them in the hangover soup

34:44.160 --> 34:46.080
to boil them together.

34:47.080 --> 34:48.400
- I was kidding.
- My third daughter.

34:53.040 --> 34:54.880
Hangover soup! Hangover soup!

34:54.960 --> 34:57.200
The incredibly aromatic hangover soup!

34:57.280 --> 34:58.960
Osmanthus hangover soup!

35:00.880 --> 35:02.960
There is enough for everyone. Be patient.

35:03.040 --> 35:05.040
It looked so bad
in the middle of the street.

35:05.120 --> 35:06.080
Mother.

35:06.720 --> 35:08.040
Mother, come on.

35:08.560 --> 35:09.600
Sit here.

35:12.720 --> 35:14.320
Well, well.

35:14.400 --> 35:16.080
How dare you do business trampling us?

35:17.040 --> 35:18.400
Send some people quickly

35:18.480 --> 35:19.760
to take down that vulgar woman.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.640
Mother, it's not a big deal.

35:21.720 --> 35:23.880
Doing that will make us all look bad.
Just let it go.

35:24.560 --> 35:26.040
I've lived for most of my life

35:26.120 --> 35:27.520
as a decent and respectful person.

35:27.600 --> 35:29.760
Today, because
of that ignorant, vulgar woman,

35:29.840 --> 35:31.400
I've lost all my dignity.

35:31.480 --> 35:32.960
If you take yourself as my son,

35:33.040 --> 35:34.200
quickly send out people

35:34.280 --> 35:35.360
- to smash her shop…
- Mother.

35:35.440 --> 35:37.200
…and immediately take her to the officials

35:37.280 --> 35:39.240
to vent my anger.

35:39.320 --> 35:41.080
Have you forgotten?
It's Mid-Autumn Festival.

35:41.160 --> 35:43.040
The officials are celebrating
the festival. Sit.

35:43.120 --> 35:44.640
There's no reason in involving

35:44.720 --> 35:47.280
the officials over this trifle, right?

35:47.880 --> 35:51.640
Madam Li has been a widow for many years,
raising several daughters by herself.

35:52.320 --> 35:55.200
It's said she was bullied by relatives
in the countryside of Luoyang.

35:55.280 --> 35:57.840
That's why she had to sell her land

35:58.560 --> 35:59.720
and come to Bianjing.

36:00.840 --> 36:02.280
If you truly take issue with her,

36:02.360 --> 36:04.640
it'd seem as if our family
is bullying them with our power.

36:05.240 --> 36:07.760
Besides, the Li family
is Lianghan's in-laws.

36:07.840 --> 36:09.640
You should consider him and his family.

36:09.720 --> 36:10.960
If you had them arrested,

36:11.040 --> 36:12.960
how would Aunt Fan feel about it?

36:13.600 --> 36:15.280
- But she…
- Mother.

36:16.880 --> 36:18.120
Upon seeing her, I can't help

36:19.360 --> 36:21.520
but remember the years
when my father just passed away

36:22.520 --> 36:23.920
and how you endured hardships

36:24.000 --> 36:25.920
to raise me
and manage the family's affairs.

36:27.240 --> 36:29.680
So, I always feel
a bit of compassion for her.

36:30.560 --> 36:32.200
She is someone with a crude manner,

36:32.280 --> 36:35.160
while you're a well-educated
and mannered person known far and wide.

36:35.240 --> 36:37.360
Considering the hardships
of a widow and her daughters,

36:37.440 --> 36:38.800
please do not take issues with her.

36:38.880 --> 36:40.040
Alright?

36:43.160 --> 36:44.680
All right, Mother.

36:46.400 --> 36:48.720
- She has daughters waiting to be married.
- Right.

36:48.800 --> 36:50.720
And she doesn't accumulate virtue
for their sake.

36:50.800 --> 36:53.560
She was that rude, fierce, and indecent.

36:54.280 --> 36:56.480
Within two days,
the whole of Bianjing will know.

36:57.280 --> 36:59.240
- Yes, you are right.
- If it were me,

36:59.320 --> 37:02.440
I would rather die without an heir
than to ever seek such a daughter-in-law.

37:02.520 --> 37:05.720
You're right. Calm down, Mother.

37:06.320 --> 37:07.160
Take my mother home.

37:07.240 --> 37:09.040
- I'll go back when I'm done here.
- Yes.

37:10.560 --> 37:11.680
Just calm down.

37:11.760 --> 37:13.280
Don't be angry anymore, Mother.

37:15.240 --> 37:16.400
Don't be angry anymore.

37:24.000 --> 37:24.960
Stop there.

37:25.040 --> 37:27.360
Under the Emperor's feet,
in a clear and civilized age,

37:27.440 --> 37:29.760
who are you scoundrels
dare to tease a respectable lady?

37:29.840 --> 37:31.080
The Emperor?

37:32.080 --> 37:34.920
Coincidentally,
the one sitting on the throne

37:35.000 --> 37:37.000
happens to be my brother-in-law,
if it comes to that.

37:37.080 --> 37:39.320
You tell me,
what kind of "scoundrel" am I?

37:39.400 --> 37:41.160
Don't bother with him. Let's go.

37:42.200 --> 37:44.120
- You…
- Don't be afraid, young lady.

37:44.720 --> 37:45.960
Women are not to my liking.

37:46.520 --> 37:48.200
Even the most beautiful woman

37:48.280 --> 37:50.000
is just a piece of wood in my eyes.

37:50.080 --> 37:54.040
I made a bet that within ten days,
I must find the person in this painting.

37:54.640 --> 37:56.200
Otherwise, I would lose a manor to him.

37:56.280 --> 37:58.240
Young lady,
let me take a good look at you.

37:58.320 --> 38:01.040
I won't give you any trouble.
I'll give you ten taels of gold instead.

38:02.680 --> 38:04.480
- Come, don't move.
- What are you doing? Let go.

38:04.560 --> 38:06.720
- He has money on him.
- Young lady!

38:09.160 --> 38:11.400
- What are you doing?
- Don't touch me.

38:11.480 --> 38:12.600
Let go of your dirty hands.

38:12.680 --> 38:13.840
- Young master!
- Get off!

38:13.920 --> 38:15.480
- What are you doing?
- Are you all blind?

38:15.560 --> 38:17.120
Do you know who I am?

38:17.200 --> 38:18.800
- Don't touch me.
- Let go!

38:18.880 --> 38:20.320
- Careful, sir.
- This is fine material.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.680
I want that jade pendant!

38:21.760 --> 38:23.200
- My belt!
- It's mine now.

38:23.280 --> 38:25.120
- It's mine now.
- My belt.

38:25.200 --> 38:26.360
Stop.

38:26.440 --> 38:28.640
- Be careful, young master.
- You've torn my clothes.

38:28.720 --> 38:29.880
Sis, let's go.

38:29.960 --> 38:32.320
All of you, back off. Go after her.

38:32.400 --> 38:34.600
- Don't touch me. Hands off.
- Take the clothes.

38:34.680 --> 38:36.960
- Young master!
- Don't touch me.

38:43.480 --> 38:45.240
Let's go. Quickly.

38:50.800 --> 38:53.040
Young master, are you alright?

38:53.120 --> 38:54.120
Sir?

38:54.200 --> 38:56.200
What are you laughing at? Stop looking.

38:56.280 --> 38:57.280
Go away.

39:00.520 --> 39:02.720
You with the veil, stop right there.

39:02.800 --> 39:03.720
Pah!

39:07.480 --> 39:08.480
Stop looking.

39:12.000 --> 39:14.160
What are you looking at?
Give me your clothes.

39:15.440 --> 39:16.360
Stop looking.

39:18.080 --> 39:19.520
- Hurry up.
- Sir.

39:20.920 --> 39:22.000
All of you, go away.

39:22.600 --> 39:23.640
Stop laughing, all of you.

39:24.680 --> 39:27.000
What are you still waiting for?
Go after her quickly.

39:27.080 --> 39:28.240
Hurry up.

39:31.000 --> 39:33.400
I have always been the one
bullying others.

39:33.480 --> 39:35.640
Li family, I'll remember you.

39:47.360 --> 39:50.920
- Slow down.
- It's truly beautiful tonight.

39:51.760 --> 39:53.640
- I want to sit on this side.
- Then I'll sit here.

39:53.720 --> 39:54.840
I'll do the cutting today.

39:54.920 --> 39:57.120
- I'll cut it.
- Last time, you did the cutting.

39:57.200 --> 39:58.880
Don't fight over it
with your elder sister.

39:58.960 --> 40:00.000
I'll cut it.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.680
Then you do it.

40:03.640 --> 40:04.760
What part do you want?

40:04.840 --> 40:07.320
- I want to eat the filling inside.
- Then who will eat the crust?

40:07.400 --> 40:09.200
- You eat it.
- I don't want the crust.

40:09.280 --> 40:11.200
- I want the filling.
- Cut it quickly.

40:11.280 --> 40:13.280
This is too hard.
I can't cut it. You do it.

40:13.360 --> 40:15.400
It has to be me in the end.

40:15.480 --> 40:18.040
Leshan, what's that new style
on your head?

40:18.720 --> 40:20.040
I've heard that inside the palace,

40:20.120 --> 40:23.040
Consort Shang and Consort Yang
are the most favored.

40:23.120 --> 40:25.160
They compete with each other
both openly and secretly.

40:25.240 --> 40:27.280
Consort Shang loves
pearl decorations in her makeup.

40:27.360 --> 40:29.640
It has been very popular
in the city recently.

40:31.840 --> 40:34.000
How is it? Doesn't it look good?

40:35.520 --> 40:37.560
Tell me. Where did you find
such fine pearls?

40:39.200 --> 40:41.560
Mother, you've been
subsidizing her secretly again.

40:41.640 --> 40:42.640
I want pearls too.

40:45.680 --> 40:46.960
I'll pluck some off you.

40:48.560 --> 40:50.120
You… Open your mouth.

40:53.600 --> 40:54.680
Where are the pearls?

40:57.800 --> 40:59.040
You're the worst.

40:59.840 --> 41:00.720
Mother.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.520
Fuhui.

41:02.600 --> 41:05.640
Didn't you say you'd spend the Festival
with the Fan's and come back tomorrow?

41:05.720 --> 41:07.080
Second sister.

41:07.800 --> 41:09.160
Our beloved little five

41:09.240 --> 41:11.040
has offended that lawless Master Yang.

41:11.120 --> 41:14.520
Even your brother-in-law can't save you.
Get up quickly. Go packing upstairs.

41:14.600 --> 41:16.240
I'll send you away to stay out of trouble.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.880
Big sis, you have to go as well.

41:20.800 --> 41:22.000
Bianjing is really different.

41:22.080 --> 41:25.080
Anyone you bump into outside
is either rich or noble.

41:25.760 --> 41:28.440
So, Master Yang
comes from a distinguished family.

41:29.600 --> 41:31.120
So what if he is an official?

41:31.200 --> 41:33.000
If he dares to come at our door,

41:33.080 --> 41:35.200
I'll chase him away with a door bolt.

41:35.960 --> 41:37.200
Mother.

41:38.440 --> 41:40.040
He's far more fearsome than any official.

41:40.120 --> 41:41.440
His elder sister

41:41.520 --> 41:43.680
is Consort Yang,
who is most favored by His Majesty.

41:44.360 --> 41:46.760
In the palace, she is even
more prestigious than the Empress.

41:46.840 --> 41:50.000
His Majesty appointed their grandfather
as the governor of Guizhou just now

41:50.080 --> 41:53.480
and will grant Master Young a position.
If he were hurt in any way,

41:53.560 --> 41:54.960
Consort Yang will be furious.

41:55.040 --> 41:56.440
They'll hold our family accountable.

41:57.120 --> 41:59.360
Mother, for our sisters' sake,

41:59.440 --> 42:01.520
promise me that you won't act rashly.

42:01.600 --> 42:02.920
Is it really that serious?

42:03.960 --> 42:05.320
Now is not the time to ask.

42:06.240 --> 42:09.360
Leshan, I will help you pack.
Just leave to avoid the trouble.

42:09.440 --> 42:10.680
If he intends to seek revenge,

42:10.760 --> 42:13.360
I'm afraid it's too late to leave now.

42:13.440 --> 42:16.080
Fuhui, did you look around
before you entered?

42:36.920 --> 42:38.600
Thirty.

42:42.160 --> 42:43.840
Forty.

42:46.320 --> 42:47.320
Indeed, some are missing.

42:48.840 --> 42:49.800
Master Yang,

42:49.880 --> 42:52.560
you insisted
that you lost your pouch in our shop,

42:52.640 --> 42:54.080
but the pouch is right here.

42:54.760 --> 42:57.080
And no one
has touched a single pearl in it.

42:57.760 --> 42:59.280
Make sure you count them well.

42:59.360 --> 43:02.320
Originally, there were
a hundred large pearls in this pouch.

43:02.400 --> 43:03.880
Now, half of them are gone.

43:03.960 --> 43:06.640
If they weren't taken by your shop,
could they have just flown away?

43:06.720 --> 43:09.440
You need evidence to back your words.

43:10.640 --> 43:12.200
Evidence?

43:12.280 --> 43:13.920
My words are the evidence.

43:14.000 --> 43:14.960
You…

43:15.040 --> 43:16.840
Right in front of everyone's eyes,

43:16.920 --> 43:18.560
you took half a bag of my pearls.

43:19.080 --> 43:20.800
Your Sifu House is clearly a shady shop.

43:21.920 --> 43:23.880
Let's take it up with the authorities.

43:24.920 --> 43:27.040
But I accept negotiation.

43:27.120 --> 43:29.560
Bring me the young lady
who robbed me that day.

43:30.560 --> 43:33.200
Have her kowtow to me.
Maybe I'll be pleased

43:33.280 --> 43:34.800
and let you off the hook.

43:35.600 --> 43:37.400
Otherwise, we'll see you in court.

43:38.200 --> 43:39.720
Once this lawsuit begins,

43:39.800 --> 43:41.840
it could last three to six months.

43:41.920 --> 43:44.520
You'll be locked up, and the shop
will be sealed for investigation.

43:45.280 --> 43:46.800
You all better think it through.

43:49.080 --> 43:51.200
Which one of us are you looking for, sir?

43:52.520 --> 43:53.560
Third Lady, don't go.

43:55.760 --> 43:57.480
Who let you out? Hurry and go back.

43:58.440 --> 44:00.720
Not you. Call out the one
from the bridge that day.

44:01.640 --> 44:05.160
What? Not me that you are looking for?

44:05.240 --> 44:06.480
Then it is my mistake.

44:06.560 --> 44:08.760
Or perhaps you have the wrong address?

44:08.840 --> 44:11.640
It's this canopy hat.
It was you. There is no mistake.

44:12.520 --> 44:13.680
What exactly do you want?

44:13.760 --> 44:17.040
Your daughter disrobed me in public
and tarnished my reputation.

44:18.120 --> 44:21.000
She can either join my house
or apologize with her death.

44:22.360 --> 44:25.360
But it's a life after all.
I've decided to take her as my concubine.

44:31.280 --> 44:33.680
- These are the betrothal gifts.
- You…

44:33.760 --> 44:34.640
Mother.

44:35.440 --> 44:36.880
Have you forgotten what Fuhui said?

44:40.680 --> 44:43.400
I will take it as a "yes" from you.
A verbal agreement is no guarantee.

44:43.480 --> 44:46.720
Let's take this skirt as proof.

44:46.800 --> 44:49.440
Three days later,
I'll deliver the betrothal gifts on time.

44:49.520 --> 44:51.040
Young lady, you must wait for me.

44:52.880 --> 44:53.760
Let's go.

44:54.400 --> 44:55.240
What…

44:58.240 --> 44:59.520
Where is Leshan?

45:00.560 --> 45:01.600
I've locked her up.

45:09.560 --> 45:11.200
Sis, if you do this for me,

45:11.280 --> 45:13.160
I will never sleep tight ever again.

45:13.240 --> 45:14.920
I don't want you to worry.

45:15.000 --> 45:15.920
I'll go talk to him.

45:17.160 --> 45:19.120
If you go to him,
I'm afraid there'll be bloodshed.

45:19.200 --> 45:21.600
If you step out of this door,
you're abandoning your mother

45:21.680 --> 45:22.520
and sisters.

45:23.200 --> 45:24.800
You promised to hold your temper.

45:24.880 --> 45:26.160
Are you trying to make me mad?

45:26.920 --> 45:30.720
I'll go to the government and accuse him
of forcing a civilian to become concubine.

45:30.800 --> 45:33.080
Now that the Yang family
is at the height of its power,

45:33.160 --> 45:35.120
who would dare to take this lawsuit?

45:35.200 --> 45:37.160
Even if someone takes it,

45:37.240 --> 45:38.520
it will be delayed and hidden.

45:38.600 --> 45:40.640
How could we be saved
from this imminent danger?

45:42.120 --> 45:44.040
That heartless Yang Xian
took away your skirt.

45:44.120 --> 45:47.080
If it's brought before the court,
your innocence might as well be discarded.

45:48.160 --> 45:50.080
Third Lady, what should we do?

45:50.160 --> 45:51.960
Let alone a pouch of pearls,

45:52.920 --> 45:54.920
even if it were a mountain of gold,

45:55.000 --> 45:58.440
we couldn't agree
to that kind of scoundrel's request.

46:10.480 --> 46:13.560
PAN RESTAURANT

46:15.040 --> 46:16.960
I have told you
all the details of the matter.

46:17.040 --> 46:18.360
Please do everything you can

46:18.440 --> 46:20.560
to dispel Yang Xian's
malicious intentions.

46:22.800 --> 46:23.760
Thank you, cousin.

46:28.080 --> 46:29.320
You want me to help her?

46:30.320 --> 46:31.640
Will the Third Lady appreciate it?

46:31.720 --> 46:33.800
My mother had a dispute with Madam Li.

46:33.880 --> 46:35.120
I'm afraid she might think

46:35.200 --> 46:36.960
I go only to mock her.
She might kick me out.

46:39.120 --> 46:41.080
Unless she asks me for help personally,

46:41.160 --> 46:43.200
then I will do my utmost to help her.

46:44.280 --> 46:46.640
- If you wish to meet her--
- No, I just can't stand injustices

46:46.720 --> 46:48.440
and want to help her out.

46:55.920 --> 46:58.080
Previously,
she was arrogant and disrespectful.

46:58.160 --> 47:00.720
Now that she's in trouble,
she has to seek help from you.

47:00.800 --> 47:03.040
If you ask me, you should not
get involved in this matter.

47:03.120 --> 47:05.360
- Let them cry out.
- Be quiet.

47:05.440 --> 47:08.680
She's my cousin's in-law,
so she's also related to me.

47:08.760 --> 47:11.800
If I didn't help her in a crucial moment,
what kind of person would I be then?

47:11.880 --> 47:13.720
When meeting him later,

47:13.800 --> 47:14.960
be patient

47:15.040 --> 47:16.760
and say a few good words.

47:16.840 --> 47:19.400
You must not be willful anymore
and bring trouble upon me.

47:19.480 --> 47:20.640
- Do you hear me?
- Of course.

50:18.760 --> 50:21.440
Subtitle translation by: Grace Zhao
